        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/katsue/{size}/2012_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-01-16T18:17:13.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>No, it doesn't set up a loop, he only takes fire damage the one time. And you've got some details wrong about Thermal Shockwave. It can target hero targets, and he takes the fire damage during the Power phase, not the end of the turn. Oh, and Isothermic Transducer is an Equipment card, not an Ongoing card.</p>",
